msgstr "Ma'ajiyar Sirri ta Shaidar Shiga"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Vault Key File"
msgstr "Fayil ɗin Maɓallin Ma'ajiyar Sirri"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key that encrypts stored credentials. Create it yourself, outside the web root, readable only by the web server and poller user, in a directory that only root and that user can write (the same applies to credential files); the plugin never creates or writes it. Back it up with the database: without it, stored credentials must be entered again."
msgstr "Cikakkiyar hanya zuwa maɓallin byte 32 da ke rufawa shaidun shiga da aka adana asiri. Ƙirƙire shi da kanka, a wajen tushen yanar gizo (web root), wanda uwar garken yanar gizo da mai amfani da mai tattara bayanai kaɗai za su iya karantawa, a cikin kundin adireshi da root da wannan mai amfani kaɗai za su iya rubutawa (haka ma ya shafi fayilolin shaidar shiga); plugin ɗin ba ya taɓa ƙirƙira ko rubuta shi. Ajiye madadinsa tare da rumbun adana bayanai: ba tare da shi ba, dole ne a sake shigar da shaidun shiga da aka adana."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Credential File Directory"
msgstr "Kundin Adireshin Fayil ɗin Shaidar Shiga"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the directory that holds credential files. An account can read its credential from a file only inside it, never the vault key file. Empty, the default, refuses credential files. Cloud Admin chooses the file, so keep only cloud credentials here."
msgstr "Cikakkiyar hanya zuwa kundin adireshin da ke riƙe fayilolin shaidar shiga. Asusu yana iya karanta shaidar shigarsa daga fayil a cikinsa kaɗai, ba fayil ɗin maɓallin ma'ajiyar sirri ba. Fanko, wanda shi ne tsohon saiti, yana ƙin fayilolin shaidar shiga. Mai Gudanarwa na Cloud ne ke zaɓar fayil ɗin, don haka a ajiye shaidun shiga na Cloud kaɗai a nan."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector"
msgstr "Mai Tattara Bayanai"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Collector Time Budget"
msgstr "Ƙayyadadden Lokacin Mai Tattara Bayanai"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Seconds one collector run may spend before it stops starting new work. Keep it below the poller interval; unfinished accounts resume on the next run."
msgstr "Daƙiƙoƙin da gudu ɗaya na mai tattara bayanai zai iya ɗauka kafin ya daina fara sabon aiki. Ajiye shi ƙasa da tazarar mai tattara bayanai; asusun da ba a gama ba za su ci gaba a gudu na gaba."

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Uninstall"
msgstr "Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "Keep Plugin Tables on Uninstall"
msgstr "Riƙe Teburan Plugin yayin Cirewa"

#: lib/Settings.php
msgid "When checked, uninstalling the plugin keeps its accounts, encrypted credentials, and cache. Clear it to have the uninstall drop them. Cloud resources are never touched either way."
msgstr "Idan aka zaɓa, cire plugin ɗin zai riƙe asusansa, shaidun shiga da aka rufa asiri, da rumbun wucin-gadi. Share zaɓin don cirewar ta zubar da su. Ba a taɓa taɓa albarkatun Cloud ta kowace hanya ba."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "Not verified yet."
msgstr "Ba a tabbatar tukuna ba."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works and has the permissions this account needs."
msgstr "Shaidar shigar tana aiki kuma tana da izinin da wannan asusun ke buƙata."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider rejected the credential. It may be wrong, expired, or revoked."
msgstr "Mai bayar da sabis ya ƙi amincewa da shaidar shigar. Tana iya zama ba daidai ba, ta ƙare, ko an soke ta."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The credential works but lacks a permission this account needs."
msgstr "Shaidar shigar tana aiki amma ba ta da wani izini da wannan asusun ke buƙata."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider could not be reached. Check the network path and outbound policy from the poller."
msgstr "Ba a iya samun mai bayar da sabis ba. Duba hanyar sadarwa da tsarin fita daga mai tattara bayanai."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider is throttling requests. Try again later."
msgstr "Mai bayar da sabis yana taƙaita buƙatu. Sake gwadawa an jima."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The provider sent a response the plugin could not read."
msgstr "Mai bayar da sabis ya aiko da amsar da plugin ɗin bai iya karantawa ba."

#: lib/VerifyStatus.php
msgid "The account or its credential is not configured correctly."
msgstr "Ba a saita asusun ko shaidar shigarsa daidai ba."

